// Core schema (DFD 7.0 & Shared D5 AI Usage Log: Users, Roles, Sessions, Notifications, System/Branding Settings, Audit Trail, AI Usage)
// Five business modules (01-leads .. 05-ai-design) own their dedicated .prisma files in this folder.

model Role {
  id          Int      @id @default(autoincrement())
  roleCode    String   @unique @map("role_code")
  roleName    String   @map("role_name")
  description String?
  createdAt   DateTime @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  users       User[]

  @@map("roles")
}

model User {
  id               Int             @id @default(autoincrement())
  roleId           Int             @map("role_id")
  fullName         String          @map("full_name")
  email            String          @unique
  phone            String?
  passwordHash     String          @map("password_hash")
  department       String          @default("sales") // 'marketing' | 'sales' | 'management' | 'admin'
  specialtyGroup   String?         @map("specialty_group") // 'led_screen' | 'electronic_board' | 'other' (UC01/UC02: phân bổ theo nhóm SP thế mạnh)
  isReceivingLeads Boolean         @default(true) @map("is_receiving_leads") // UC01/UC02: trạng thái nhận Lead (tách khỏi is_active)
  isOnline         Boolean         @default(false) @map("is_online") // UC01/UC02: trạng thái online khi điều phối
  avatarUrl        String?         @map("avatar_url")
  isActive         Boolean         @default(true) @map("is_active")
  deletedAt        DateTime?       @map("deleted_at")
  createdAt        DateTime        @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  updatedAt        DateTime        @updatedAt @map("updated_at")
  role             Role            @relation(fields: [roleId], references: [id])
  sessions         UserSession[]
  notifications    Notification[]
  uploadedAssets   BrandingAsset[]
  auditLogs        AuditLog[]
  aiUsageLogs      AiUsageLog[]    @relation("AiUsageUser")

  // Quan hệ ngược sang Module 01 (Quản lý Lead & Pipeline)
  assignedLeads           Lead[]            @relation("LeadAssignedSales")
  createdLeads            Lead[]            @relation("LeadCreatedBy")
  receivedLeads           Lead[]            @relation("LeadReceivedBy")
  uploadedLeadAttachments LeadAttachment[]  @relation("LeadAttachmentUploadedBy")
  leadActivities          LeadActivity[]    @relation("LeadActivityActor")
  activitiesFromSales     LeadActivity[]    @relation("LeadActivityFromSales")
  activitiesToSales       LeadActivity[]    @relation("LeadActivityToSales")
  priceCheckAlertsCreated PriceCheckAlert[] @relation("PriceCheckCreatedBy")
  priceCheckAlertsRemoved PriceCheckAlert[] @relation("PriceCheckRemovedBy")

  // Quan hệ ngược sang Module 02 (Tracking & Đồng bộ)
  resolvedReconciliations LeadReconciliation[] @relation("ReconciliationResolvedBy")

  // Quan hệ ngược sang Module 03 (Nội dung SEO tích hợp AI)
  seoArticlesCreated  SeoArticle[]         @relation("SeoArticleCreatedBy")
  seoArticlesApproved SeoArticle[]         @relation("SeoArticleApprovedBy")
  seoArticleRevisions SeoArticleRevision[] @relation("SeoRevisionEditedBy")

  // Quan hệ ngược sang Module 05 (Hỗ trợ Thiết kế & Phối cảnh AI)
  designRequestsCreated       DesignRequest[]      @relation("DesignRequestedBySales")
  designRequestsAssigned      DesignRequest[]      @relation("DesignAssignedDesigner")
  designAssetVersionsUploaded DesignAssetVersion[] @relation("DesignAssetUploadedBy")

  @@index([roleId])
  @@index([department, isActive, isReceivingLeads])
  @@index([deletedAt])
  @@map("users")
}

model UserSession {
  id        String    @id @default(cuid())
  tokenHash String    @unique @map("token_hash")
  csrfToken String    @map("csrf_token")
  userId    Int       @map("user_id")
  ipAddress String?   @map("ip_address")
  userAgent String?   @map("user_agent")
  expiresAt DateTime  @map("expires_at")
  revokedAt DateTime? @map("revoked_at")
  createdAt DateTime  @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  user      User      @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([userId])
  @@index([expiresAt])
  @@map("user_sessions")
}

model Notification {
  id                 Int       @id @default(autoincrement())
  userId             Int       @map("user_id")
  title              String
  summary            String
  category           String    @default("Hệ thống")
  actionLabel        String?   @map("action_label")
  actionUrl          String?   @map("action_url")
  requiredPermission String?   @map("required_permission")
  isRead             Boolean   @default(false) @map("is_read")
  readAt             DateTime? @map("read_at")
  createdAt          DateTime  @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  user               User      @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([userId, isRead])
  @@map("notifications")
}

model BrandingAsset {
  id            Int      @id @default(autoincrement())
  slot          String   // 'logo' | 'login_hero' | 'dashboard_banner'
  objectKey     String   @unique @map("object_key")
  mimeType      String   @map("mime_type")
  fileSizeBytes Int      @map("file_size_bytes")
  width         Int
  height        Int
  sha256        String
  altText       String   @map("alt_text")
  coverPosition String   @default("center") @map("cover_position")
  cropJson      String?  @map("crop_json")
  isActive      Boolean  @default(true) @map("is_active")
  uploadedById  Int      @map("uploaded_by_id")
  createdAt     DateTime @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  uploadedBy    User     @relation(fields: [uploadedById], references: [id])

  @@index([slot, isActive])
  @@map("branding_assets")
}

model SystemSetting {
  key          String   @id
  value        String
  updatedById  Int?     @map("updated_by_id")
  updatedAt    DateTime @updatedAt @map("updated_at")

  @@map("system_settings")
}

model AuditLog {
  id          Int      @id @default(autoincrement())
  actorUserId Int?     @map("actor_user_id")
  action      String
  targetType  String   @map("target_type")
  targetId    String?  @map("target_id")
  detailsJson String?  @map("details_json")
  ipAddress   String?  @map("ip_address")
  createdAt   DateTime @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  actor       User?    @relation(fields: [actorUserId], references: [id], onDelete: SetNull)

  @@index([actorUserId])
  @@index([createdAt])
  @@map("audit_logs")
}

// Kho D5 trong DFD: Nhật ký sử dụng AI dùng chung (Owner ghi: Core contract; Consumer phát sinh: M03 & M05; Đọc báo cáo: M04)
model AiUsageLog {
  id                Int                 @id @default(autoincrement())
  idempotencyKey    String              @unique @map("idempotency_key") // Chống nhân bản khi callback lặp nhưng giữ riêng từng lần thử thật
  attemptNumber     Int                 @default(1) @map("attempt_number")
  providerRequestId String?             @map("provider_request_id")
  moduleCode        String              @map("module_code") // '03-keywords-ads' | '05-ai-design'
  taskType          String              @map("task_type") // 'seo_outline' | 'seo_draft' | '3d_perspective' | 'banner'
  userId            Int                 @map("user_id")
  designRequestId   Int?                @map("design_request_id")
  seoArticleId      Int?                @map("seo_article_id")
  modelName         String              @default("gemini-2.5-flash") @map("model_name")
  // Nullable khi provider không trả về hoặc lượt gọi lỗi/timeout (DATA_SAFETY: không ghi số 0 giả)
  promptTokens      Int?                @map("prompt_tokens")
  completionTokens  Int?                @map("completion_tokens")
  totalTokens       Int?                @map("total_tokens")
  costMicros        BigInt?             @map("cost_micros") // 1 đơn vị tiền tệ = 1,000,000 micros (giữ nguyên phần lẻ, không tự quy đổi tỷ giá)
  costCurrency      String?             @map("cost_currency") // 'USD' | 'VND' theo đúng đơn vị provider trả về
  durationMs        Int?                @map("duration_ms") // Ghi nhận mỗi khi đo được, kể cả khi failed/timeout
  status            String              @default("success") // 'success' | 'failed' | 'timeout'
  errorMessage      String?             @map("error_message")
  createdAt         DateTime            @default(now()) @map("created_at")

  user               User                @relation("AiUsageUser", fields: [userId], references: [id])
  designRequest      DesignRequest?      @relation(fields: [designRequestId], references: [id], onDelete: SetNull)
  seoArticle         SeoArticle?         @relation(fields: [seoArticleId], references: [id], onDelete: SetNull)
  designAssetVersion DesignAssetVersion?

  @@index([moduleCode, createdAt])
  @@index([userId, createdAt])
  @@index([designRequestId])
  @@index([seoArticleId])
  @@map("ai_usage_logs")
}
